{
  "description": "Non-material amendment of planning permission ref: 2025/1484 (dated 12/09/2025) for \"infill side extension at first floor and erection of a single-storey extension including terrace and rooftop with green roof and installation of an Air Source Heat Pump. Demolition of existing atrium and the north-east facade with redevelopment of the facade to include new fenestration, entrance door and associated works. Development of plant room at lower ground floor.\"Amendments sought:Reduce ASHP on the roof from 3 to 2;Revise internal layout for cinema and prep kitchen at lower ground floor;Revise layout to first floor to increase size of terrace;Revise layout to second floor to reduce massing and align with terrace below;Revise second floor terrace from wrap around terrace to two separate areas front and rear;Revise roof plan to align with changes to first and second floor;Update note on privacy screens to include 'timber'; andBrickwork to be retained and soot washed where feasible and replace buff with London Stock brick to match existing.",
