  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-839d9e71-7fff-827d-72ac-d795d910eff8&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;The proposed amendments, by reason of the changes to the upper floor layout, roof form, and elevated external terraces constitute a minor material amendment rather than a non-material change. The application fails to meet the test under Section 96A and must be dealt with via Section 73 (variation of condition) to allow for formal neighbour notification and assessment of design and amenity impacts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
